{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00706",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.01,
      "end_seconds": 18.88,
      "duration_seconds": 17.87,
      "text": "Oh, hello, doctor. Gosh, it's the scar, you see, it's been months and it still hurts, and it's right where my skirt rubs, and I told my daughter, she's getting married in June, a lovely lad, a plumber..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.73,
      "end_seconds": 26.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.63,
      "text": "Congratulations to her. Which scar, Margaret, remind me? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.98,
      "end_seconds": 43.29,
      "duration_seconds": 15.31,
      "text": "The hip. The new hip, four months ago, on the left. The pain around the scar, it's like a burning, and a bit numb on the side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.01,
      "end_seconds": 47.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "How long has the burning been there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 50.01,
      "end_seconds": 60.66,
      "duration_seconds": 10.65,
      "text": "Since about a month after the operation, so, three months, nearly? Though I had the tingling in January too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.8,
      "end_seconds": 66.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.67,
      "text": "And the numb patch, is that the same area?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.04,
      "end_seconds": 81.06,
      "duration_seconds": 13.02,
      "text": "Yes, just on the outside of the thigh. Oh, and the hip itself is stiff in the mornings, I can't get my tights on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.98,
      "end_seconds": 84.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "Any fever or sweats?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.91,
      "end_seconds": 94.98,
      "duration_seconds": 9.07,
      "text": "No, no fever at all. I took my temperature, I've got that thermometer you put in your ear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.41,
      "end_seconds": 100.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "Any discharge, any weeping from the scar?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.62,
      "end_seconds": 108.42,
      "duration_seconds": 4.8,
      "text": "Nothing like that, it's dry as a bone."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.84,
      "end_seconds": 114.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "What are you taking at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.17,
      "end_seconds": 129.74,
      "duration_seconds": 12.57,
      "text": "Tramadol, 50 mg, twice a day. Paracetamol, 1 gram, four times. Lansoprazole, 30 mg, in the morning, for my stomach, and levothyroxine, 75 micrograms, first thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.02,
      "end_seconds": 133.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "Good. Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 136.22,
      "end_seconds": 147.4,
      "duration_seconds": 11.18,
      "text": "Yes. Iodine. I react, they put it on my wristband at the hospital, but I can never remember what it does to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.52,
      "end_seconds": 154.29,
      "duration_seconds": 5.77,
      "text": "That's fine, we'll note iodine. What conditions do you have?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.67,
      "end_seconds": 162.38,
      "duration_seconds": 5.71,
      "text": "Underactive thyroid, acid reflux, and the thin bones, osteoporosis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.15,
      "end_seconds": 166.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "Any operations apart from the hip?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 167.5,
      "end_seconds": 174.21,
      "duration_seconds": 6.71,
      "text": "The hip, four months ago, and my cataract in 2019, the left eye."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.21,
      "end_seconds": 179.28,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "Any bone problems in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 181.29,
      "end_seconds": 185.87,
      "duration_seconds": 4.58,
      "text": "My mother broke her hip when she was eighty."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.83,
      "end_seconds": 190.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "What did you do for work?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 193.38,
      "end_seconds": 199.4,
      "duration_seconds": 6.02,
      "text": "I was a nurse, retired now. Thirty-five years on the wards."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.5,
      "end_seconds": 204.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "Where do you live?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 206.41,
      "end_seconds": 212.24,
      "duration_seconds": 5.83,
      "text": "A second-floor flat, no lift, so the stairs are a battle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.28,
      "end_seconds": 218.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "And have you been doing the exercises?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 219.44,
      "end_seconds": 226.36,
      "duration_seconds": 6.92,
      "text": "The physio ones, yes, every morning, apart from when it hurts too much."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.33,
      "end_seconds": 254.91,
      "duration_seconds": 11.58,
      "text": "Let me do your numbers. Pulse 72, blood pressure 138 over 84, temperature 36.8, oxygen 97 percent, breathing 16, weight 64 kilos."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 257.77,
      "end_seconds": 268.78,
      "duration_seconds": 11.01,
      "text": "Is that all right? Oh, my daughter's fiancÃ© fixed our boiler last year, that's how they met. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.76,
      "end_seconds": 285.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "Lovely. Let's look at the scar."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 288.38,
      "end_seconds": 291.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Mind the skirt. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.2,
      "end_seconds": 303.11,
      "duration_seconds": 10.91,
      "text": "The scar is healed and dry, with no redness or swelling. But the skin along it is very tender to light touch."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 305.89,
      "end_seconds": 311.11,
      "duration_seconds": 5.22,
      "text": "Yes, that's the burning, even the sheet bothers me. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 313.84,
      "end_seconds": 318.21,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "Any problem with your chest or breathing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 320.72,
      "end_seconds": 324.72,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "No, nothing, I'm fine in that department."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 326.78,
      "end_seconds": 343.65,
      "duration_seconds": 16.87,
      "text": "The scar looks healed, and I think this is irritation of a small skin nerve, which is common after hip surgery, but I can't completely rule out a deep infection."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 346.24,
      "end_seconds": 350.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "Oh dear, is it infected? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 352.44,
      "end_seconds": 365.81,
      "duration_seconds": 13.37,
      "text": "I doubt it, but I'd like to check. I'd like to arrange an X-ray of the hip, and blood tests for inflammation and infection markers."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 368.56,
      "end_seconds": 373.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "Can I carry on with the exercises? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 375.82,
      "end_seconds": 386.54,
      "duration_seconds": 10.72,
      "text": "Yes. I'd also like to do an ultrasound scan around the scar, and a bone density scan, since you have osteoporosis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 389.0,
      "end_seconds": 392.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "When would that be? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 393.73,
      "end_seconds": 403.93,
      "duration_seconds": 10.2,
      "text": "The bone scan can wait a few weeks. I'd like to see you again in two weeks with the results."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 405.68,
      "end_seconds": 410.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.97,
      "text": "Two weeks. I'll put it on the fridge. ~"
    }
  ]
}
